### Đăng ký tài khoản mới
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User2",
  "email": "huyooocom@gmail.com",
  "password": "Test@12345",
  "phone": "0123456789"
}

### Xác thực email (copy token từ console log: ">>> EMAIL VERIFICATION" hoặc "Email sent to")
# GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/verify?token=UUID_TOKEN

### Gửi lại email xác thực
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "huyooocom@gmail.com"
}

### Đăng nhập -> tự động lưu accessToken + refreshToken
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
    client.global.set("refreshToken", response.body.data.refreshToken);
%}

### Lấy thông tin profile (dùng accessToken từ login)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Refresh token (dùng refreshToken từ login)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### Quên mật khẩu
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### Đặt lại mật khẩu (copy token từ console log sau khi gọi forgot-password)
# POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/reset-password
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "token": "UUID_TOKEN",
#   "password": "NewPass@456"
# }

### Test endpoint (không cần auth)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test
